{"t":"TTWO","made":"2026-11-27 02:42","name":"Take-Two Interactive Software, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Electronic Gaming & Multimedia","employees":12909,"hq":"New York, NY, United States","website":"https://www.take2games.com","summary_en":"Take-Two Interactive Software, Inc. develops, publishes, and markets interactive entertainment solutions for consumers worldwide. The company develops and publishes action/adventure products under the Grand Theft Auto, LA Noire, Max Payne, Midnight Club, and Red Dead Redemption names, as well as other franchises. It also publishes various entertainment properties across various platforms and a range of genres, such as shooter, action, role-playing, strategy, sports, and family/casual entertainment under the BioShock, Mafia, Sid Meier's Civilization, XCOM series, Borderlands, and Tiny Tina's Wonderland names. In addition, the company publishes sports simulation titles comprising NBA 2K series, a basketball video game; the WWE 2K professional wrestling series; mobile titles, including WWE SuperCard; and PGA TOUR 2K. Further, it offers free-to-play mobile games, such as CSR Racing, Dragon City, Empires & Puzzles, FarmVille 3, Game of Thrones: Legends, Golf Rival, Harry Potter: Puzzles & Spells, Hit It Rich!, Match Factory!, Merge Dragons!, Merge Magic!, Monster Legends, NBA 2K, Toon Blast, Top Eleven, Wizard Of Oz Slots Casino, Toy Blast, Words With Friends, and Zynga Poker; and Color Block Jam. The company's products are designed for console gaming systems; and mobiles, such as smartphones, tablets, and personal computers. It provides its products through physical retail, digital download, online platforms, and cloud streaming services. Take-Two Interactive Software, Inc. was incorporated in 1993 and is based in New York, New York.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Take-Two Interactive Software, Inc.는 전 세계 소비자를 위한 대화형 엔터테인먼트 솔루션을 개발, 출판 및 판매합니다. 이 회사는 Grand Theft Auto, LA Noire, Max Payne, Midnight Club, Red Dead Redemption 및 기타 프랜차이즈 이름으로 액션/어드벤처 제품을 개발하고 출판합니다. 또한 BioShock, Mafia, Sid Meier's Civilization, XCOM 시리즈, Borderlands 및 Tiny Tina's Wonderland라는 이름으로 슈팅 게임, 액션, 롤플레잉, 전략, 스포츠, 가족/캐주얼 엔터테인먼트 등 다양한 플랫폼과 다양한 장르에 걸쳐 다양한 엔터테인먼트 자산을 게시합니다. 또한 회사는 농구 비디오 게임인 NBA 2K 시리즈로 구성된 스포츠 시뮬레이션 타이틀을 출시합니다. WWE 2K 프로레슬링 시리즈; WWE SuperCard를 포함한 모바일 타이틀; 그리고 PGA 투어 2K. 또한 CSR Racing, Dragon City, Empires & Puzzles, FarmVille 3, Game of Thrones: Legends, Golf Rival, Harry Potter: Puzzles & Spells, Hit It Rich!, Match Factory!, Merge Dragons!, Merge Magic!, Monster Legends, NBA 2K, Toon Blast, Top Eleven, Wizard Of Oz Slots Casino, Toy Blast, Words With Friends 및 Zynga Poker와 같은 무료 모바일 게임을 제공합니다. 및 컬러 블록 잼. 이 회사의 제품은 콘솔 게임 시스템용으로 설계되었습니다. 스마트폰, 태블릿, 개인용 컴퓨터 등의 모바일 기기도 포함됩니다. 실제 소매, 디지털 다운로드, 온라인 플랫폼 및 클라우드 스트리밍 서비스를 통해 제품을 제공합니다. Take-Two Interactive Software, Inc. 1993년에 설립되었으며 뉴욕주 뉴욕에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":227.34,"mcap":42561114112.0,"pe":null,"fpe":22.532558,"peg":2.8378,"ps":6.6401105,"pb":11.584794,"ev_ebitda":60.421,"div":0.0,"beta":0.918,"hi52":265.94,"lo52":183.86},"fin":{"rev":6409699840.0,"rev_g":-0.156,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.57722,"op":-0.017549999,"net":-0.037520003,"roe":-0.06769,"fcf":787574976.0,"cash":1673600000.0,"debt":2911399936.0,"de":79.252,"eps":-1.29,"feps":10.0894},"own":{"short":0.0506,"inst":1.00471,"insider":0.018},"analyst":{"n":29,"mean":285.48,"median":290.0,"high":350.0,"low":170.0,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":1.2069,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":25,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":25,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":25,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":3,"buy":25,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-10","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":295.0,"priorPriceTarget":300.0